        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It&#39;s been clarified many times that when a deck runs out of cards and you need to play or discard from that deck, you reshuffle the trash into the deck; but you don&#39;t do this when you need to, for instance, reveal cards from the deck. But there doesn&#39;t seem to be as prominent an official source for this as I&#39;d expect. It&#39;s in Spiff&#39;s FAQ, but it&#39;s not in the &quot;official rulings&quot; forum, and the version of the rulebook that you can download at sentinelsofthemultiverse doesn&#39;t have any rule about reshuffling that I can see. Can we get an official ruling to this effect to point people to?</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
